                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">This model requires a personal access token for your Speckle account.
How to create one: https://speckle.guide/dev/tokens.html

The folllowing scopes are required: 
"profile:read", "streams:read", "streams:write"

WARNING: Storing your token in a Grasshopper file, or importing it 
using a ShapeDiver Text input, is not good practice for security. 

We recommend to store API keys and passwords in your ShapeDiver account 
and using the ShapeDiver Secret input to retrieve them in your definitions.</item>
